files["methodology.html"]=page("Methodology",
"<h1>Methodology - How Every Number Was Produced</h1><h2>Formulas (all money rounded to $10)</h2><ul>"
+"<li><strong>Assessed (no transfer):</strong> assessed(t) = assessed(2026) x 1.02^(t-2026) (Prop 13 cap, BOE).</li>"
+"<li><strong>Market (assumed):</strong> market(t) = market(2026) x (1+g)^(t-2026), g = 2%, 3%, or 4% - <em>assumptions</em>.</li>"
+"<li><strong>Prop 19 move-in assessed:</strong> factored base + max(0, market - factored base - $1,000,000).</li>"
+"<li><strong>Full reassessment (rent/sell):</strong> assessed = market.</li>"
+"<li><strong>Property tax:</strong> assessed x effective rate (Cupertino 1.335%, SF 2.135% user-implied; nominal sensitivities 1.20% / 1.18%).</li>"
+"<li><strong>Carrying cost:</strong> tax + insurance benchmark + water + electric + maintenance assumption.</li>"
+"<li><strong>Break-even rent:</strong> total annual cost / 12.</li>"
+"<li><strong>Sell &amp; reinvest:</strong> net = market x (1 - 6% selling costs); future = net x (1+r)^n, r = 4%, 7%, or 10% - <em>assumptions</em>.</li></ul>"
+"<h2>Reproduce</h2><pre>python3 scripts/calculate.py   # writes data/*.csv + data/summary.json\npython3 scripts/build_site.py  # regenerates all HTML pages</pre>"
+"<h2>Limitations</h2><ul><li>Income tax on rent/gains excluded from net figures (bracket-dependent).</li><li>No vacancy, management-fee, or major-capital-expenditure (roof/seismic) allowance beyond the maintenance assumption.</li><li>Laws as of Nov 2026; exemption indexed from 2027; future legislatures can change any rule.</li><li>Not legal, tax, or investment advice.</li></ul>")

